// "DealsCombatDamage" = combat damage is dealt to a recipient ([CR#510.2] —
// "all combat damage that's been assigned is dealt simultaneously"; the
// triggering abilities this event backs go on the stack afterward
// [CR#510.3a]). The recipient is the kind-poly damage patient ([CR#510.1b]
// a player/planeswalker/battle when unblocked, [CR#510.1c] a blocking
// creature when blocked). Mirrors event/Attacks + event/Dies. Usage:
// DealsCombatDamage(source, to) — e.g. DealsCombatDamage(Ref(This), Player).
(
    name: "DealsCombatDamage",
    template: "${0} deals combat damage to ${1}",
    kinds: [EventFilter],
    params: [Predicate, Predicate],
    body: Damage(source: Param(0), to: Param(1), combat: true),
)
